```text
ORDINANCE NO. ________

ENTITLED: “AN ORDINANCE AMENDING THE OFFICIAL ZONING MAP OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, CHANGING THE ZONING CLASSIFICATION
FOR LAND LOCATED IN CHEYENNE BUSINESS PARK AND
CAMPSTOOL BUSINESS PARK IN EASTERN CHEYENNE ALONG I-80
FROM LI – LIGHT INDUSTRIAL, HI – HEAVY INDUSTRIAL, AND CB –
COMMUNITY BUSINESS TO BP – BUSINESS PARK.”

BE IT ORDAINED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE,
WYOMING:

Section 1.  That the City of Cheyenne Planning and Development Department has initiated,
through a petition to the Governing Body, a zoning map amendment for land located in eastern
Cheyenne and along I-80 in accordance with Section 2.2.1, Zoning Map Amendment, of the
Cheyenne Unified Development Code (“UDC”).

Section 2.  That on May 4, 2026, the City of Cheyenne Planning Commission conducted a
public hearing, reviewed the proposed zoning map amendment that is the subject of this ordinance,
and recommended approval of said zoning map amendment.

Section 3.  That the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne finds that the zoning map
amendment that is the subject of this ordinance meets the criteria specified in Section 2.2.1.d of
the UDC.

Section 4.  That, in accordance with Section 2.2.1, Zoning Map Amendment, Section 5.1.2,
Zoning Districts Established, and Section 5.1.3, Official Zoning Map, of the UDC, the
aforementioned zoning map amendment application is hereby approved and the zoning
classification of the real property described below:

Lot 1, Block 1, Rocky Mountain Industrial Park, 5th Filing;
Lots 1 and 2, Block 1, Rocky Mountain Industrial Park Addition, 6th Filing;
Lots 1 and 2, Block 1, Cheyenne Business Parkway, 10th Filing;
Lot 1, Block 1, Cheyenne Business Parkway, 1st Filing, Refinement B;
Lots 1-4, Block 1, Progress Circle Business Center, Revision A;
Lots 4-9, Block 1, Cheyenne Business Parkway, 1st Filing;
Lot 15, Block 1, Cheyenne Business Parkway, 1st Filing;
Lots 1-4, Block 3, Cheyenne Business Parkway, 1st Filing;
Lots 1-4, Block 1, Cheyenne Business Parkway, 9th Filing;
Lot 1, Block 1, Cheyenne Business Parkway, 2nd Filing;
Lot 1 and 2, Block 6, Cheyenne Business Parkway 1st Filing;
Tract 25, Rocky Mountain Industrial Park Additon, 3rd Filing;
Tract 1, Rocky Mountain Industrial Park Addition, 4th Filing;
Tracts 15 -18 Rocky Mountain Industrial Park Addition, 3rd Filing;
Lot 1-3, Bronco Subdivision;
Tract 1, Dry Creek Waste Water Treatment Plant, 1st Filing;
8:08 am, Jun 01 2026
```

